### equivs control template, filled in by kernel/build-kernel.sh.
### @KREL@ is the kernel release, @PKGVERSION@ the kernel packages' version,
### @METAVERSION@ this package's version, @MAINTAINER@ the build's maintainer.
Source: linux-zabbly-arca
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/weunfold/arca-os
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: linux-zabbly
Version: @METAVERSION@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Architecture: amd64
Depends: linux-image-@KREL@ (= @PKGVERSION@), linux-headers-@KREL@ (= @PKGVERSION@)
Description: Linux kernel with Android binder, for Arca OS
 This package brings in Zabbly's stable mainline kernel, rebuilt by
 Arca OS with Android binder and binderfs built in. Matching headers
 are also pulled in.
